        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "none",
      "overlay_text": "",
      "narration": "Today, we're exploring five of the most terrifying creatures ever associated with the world's waters. And trust me, the final one has a history that goes back thousands of years. Let's begin."
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "s02_01",
      "scene": 2,
