        "duration_sec": 10.318,
        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "none",
      "overlay_text": "1. CHAMP",
      "narration": "Number one: Champ. On July 5, 1977, Sandra Mansi was spending time with her family near Lake Champlain when something unusual happened offshore."
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "s02_02",
      "scene": 2,
      "scene_title": "Champ",
      "start_sec": 36.56,
      "end_sec": 45.001,
      "duration_sec": 8.441,
      "image": {
        "path": "images/s02_02.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "clip": null,
      "audio": {
        "path": "voiceover/s02_02.mp3",
        "status": "ready",
        "duration_sec": 7.941,
        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "none",
      "overlay_text": "",
      "narration": "Around 150 feet away, the normally calm water suddenly started moving violently. First, a large hump appeared above the surface."
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "s02_03",
      "scene": 2,
      "scene_title": "Champ",
      "start_sec": 45.001,
      "end_sec": 49.707,
      "duration_sec": 4.706,
      "image": {
        "path": "images/s02_03.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "clip": {
        "path": "clips/s02_03.mp4",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "path": "voiceover/s02_03.mp3",
        "status": "ready",
        "duration_sec": 4.206,
        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "none",
      "overlay_text": "",
      "narration": "Then something resembling a long neck slowly emerged, ending in a small head."
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "s02_04",
      "scene": 2,
      "scene_title": "Champ",
      "start_sec": 49.707,
      "end_sec": 63.529,
      "duration_sec": 13.822,
