        "status": "ready",
        "duration_sec": 13.531,
        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "none",
      "overlay_text": "JULY 11, 2005",
      "narration": "Then, on July 11, 2005, two fishermen named Dick Affolter and Pete Bodette were out searching for salmon when they noticed something unusual floating near the surface. Initially, they assumed it was just a piece of driftwood."
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "s02_09",
      "scene": 2,
      "scene_title": "Champ",
      "start_sec": 108.709,
      "end_sec": 123.655,
      "duration_sec": 14.946,
      "image": {
        "path": "images/s02_09.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "clip": {
        "path": "clips/s02_09.mp4",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "path": "voiceover/s02_09.mp3",
        "status": "ready",
        "duration_sec": 14.446,
        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "none",
      "overlay_text": "",
      "narration": "But then the object started moving. Its body appeared to travel through the water in a winding, snake-like motion. Affolter later described seeing a visible section of its back measuring roughly 10 to 13 feet, along with an unusually shaped head."
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "s02_10",
      "scene": 2,
      "scene_title": "Champ",
      "start_sec": 123.655,
      "end_sec": 133.246,
      "duration_sec": 9.591,
      "image": {
        "path": "images/s02_10.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "clip": null,
      "audio": {
        "path": "voiceover/s02_10.mp3",
        "status": "ready",
        "duration_sec": 9.091,
        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "none",
      "overlay_text": "",
      "narration": "The mysterious object suddenly disappeared beneath the surface. About an hour later, it appeared again, and this time Bodette managed to capture footage from their boat."
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "s02_11",
      "scene": 2,
      "scene_title": "Champ",
      "start_sec": 133.246,
      "end_sec": 145.736,
