        "duration_sec": 10.658,
        "words": []
      },
      "motion": "none",
      "overlay_text": "3. TITANOBOA",
      "narration": "Number three: Titanoboa. Around 60 million years ago, the rivers of what is now Colombia were home to a snake so enormous that even today's largest snakes would look tiny beside it."
    },
    {
